msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Yasuko「Sweeeeet～～～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Dulceeee～～～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What is it, Yasuko? Start from the＿beginning.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué pasa, Yasuko? Empieza＿desde el principio.」"

msgid "Yasuko「I smell something sweeeet～～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Huelo algo dulceee～～」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ah, Ryuu-chan, morning～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ah, Ryuu-chan, buenos días～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Morning. Changing the subject, huh.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Buenos días. Cambiando de tema, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Did you make enough for Yacchan～?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Hiciste suficiente para Yacchan～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And we're back. Yeah, of course I did.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y volvemos al tema. Sí, claro que sí.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yaaay...... huh?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Siii...... ¿eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's the matter?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué ocurre?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan's wearing his uniformmm～＿Going to school todayyy?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan lleva puesto su uniformeee～＿¿Hoy vas a la escuelaaa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You only just noticed? I told you the＿opening ceremony is today, didn't I?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Apenas te das cuenta?＿Te dije que hoy es la ceremonia＿de apertura, ¿no?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Oh, come to think of it, maybe you＿did～ Hmmm...... Ryuu-chan's going＿back to school today...... *Yawnnnn*」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ah, ahora que lo pienso, puede que＿sí～ Mmmm...... Ryuu-chan vuelve hoy＿a la escuela...... *Bostezooo*」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You can go back to sleep. I'll save＿some pancakes for you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Puedes volver a dormir. Te guardaré＿algunos panqueques.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yacchan...... wants maple syrup on top,＿please......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Yacchan...... quiere jarabe de＿arce encima, por favor......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay, I'll be sure to set some aside.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien, me aseguraré de apartar un poco.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Thanks...... Yacchan's going back to＿bed......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Gracias...... Yacchan se va＿a volver a acostar......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sleep tight.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Que descanses.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Good nighttt......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Buenas nochesss......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Now then, I guess I'll get the rest done＿now.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Bueno, supongo que terminaré＿el resto ahora.）」"

msgid "Taiga「What's for breakfast today? The＿second I came in, I could smell＿something sweet.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué hay hoy de desayuno? Apenas＿entré, pude oler algo dulce.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What, are you guys taking turns?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué, acaso se turnan?」"

msgid "Taiga「What are you talking about?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿De qué estás hablando?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nothing. We're having pancakes today.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nada. Hoy desayunamos panqueques.」"

msgid "Taiga「Wow...... Well, that's not a bad idea.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Vaya...... Bueno, no es mala idea.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「If you're happy about it, just be honest.＿I can see that big grin on your face.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Si te alegra, solo admítelo. Puedo ver＿esa enorme sonrisa en tu cara.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, alright, hang on.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien, está bien, espera.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, can't you walk a little faster?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga, ¿no puedes caminar＿un poco más rápido?」"

msgid "Taiga「But I'm so full. Let me walk at my own＿pace.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Pero estoy muy llena. Déjame＿caminar a mi ritmo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Sheesh, don't overeat then, dork.＿You even fuckin' snagged some of＿mine.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Vaya, entonces no comas de＿más, tonta. Hasta me robaste parte＿de los míos, maldita sea.」"

msgid "Taiga「You weren't eating it fast enough, so I＿was tidying up the plate for you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No comías lo bastante rápido, así que＿te estaba limpiando el plato.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just admit that you overate because it＿was so good.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Solo admite que comiste de más＿porque estaba delicioso.」"

msgid "Minori「Yoo-hoo～ Taiga! Takasu-kun!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Yujuuu～ Taiga! ¡Takasu-kun!」"

msgid "Taiga「Minorin!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Minorin!」"

msgid "Minori「Happy belated new year! Kushieda＿Minori is in your hands for another＿year!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Feliz Año Nuevo atrasado! ¡Kushieda＿Minori queda en sus manos un año más!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Happy New Year. Come to think of it,＿Kushieda, this is the first time I've＿seen you since the start of the year.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Feliz Año Nuevo. Ahora que lo pienso,＿Kushieda, es la primera vez que te＿veo desde que empezó el año.」"

msgid "Taiga「Minorin, you were at your grandma's＿house, right?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Minorin, estuviste en casa＿de tu abuela, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Minori「Yup. I got to kick back and relax the＿whole time～」"
msgstr "Minori「Sip. Pude descansar y relajarme＿todo el tiempo～」"

msgid "Minori「Oh yeah! Did you guys solve the case＿of Takasu-kun's Missing Memories＿while I was gone?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ah, sí! ¿Resolvieron el caso de＿los Recuerdos Perdidos de Takasu-kun＿mientras no estaba?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, the culprit's still at large......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, el culpable sigue suelto......」"

msgid "Minori「Hmmm～ ......Seems like it's not a＿problem that will fix itself. That's not＿good......」"
msgstr "Minori「Mmmm～ ......Parece que no es un＿problema que vaya a arreglarse＿solo. Eso no es bueno......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? You've been helping me＿remember? Are you joking!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿Que has estado ayudándome＿a recordar? ¡¿Es broma?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So? Even if I don't get help from you,＿Kitamura could probably cover for me＿pretty well, so I'm not worried.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y qué? Aunque no me ayudes, seguro＿que Kitamura puede cubrirme bastante＿bien, así que no me preocupo.」"

msgid "Minori「I plan to lend a hand too, see. If＿anything goes wrong, don't you＿hesitate to tell me.」"
msgstr "Minori「Yo también pienso echar una＿mano, ¿ves? Si algo sale mal,＿no dudes en decírmelo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Minorin, you can forget about taking＿over. I don't want you at his beck and＿call.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Minorin, olvídate de tomar el relevo. No＿quiero que estés a su disposición.」"

msgid "Minori「Harsh of you, Taiga. People are＿naturally mutually supportive＿creatures, ya know?」"
msgstr "Minori「Qué dura eres, Taiga. Las personas＿somos criaturas que se apoyan mutuamente＿por naturaleza, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, Kushieda, that's deep!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Oh, Kushieda, qué profundo!」"

msgid "Taiga「......No I won't.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......No lo haré.」"

msgid "Minori「Huh? Where are you going,＿Takasu-kun? The classroom's this way,＿bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Eh? ¿Adónde vas, Takasu-kun? El＿salón queda por aquí, amigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, I've got a little something to take＿care of......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, tengo un asuntito que resolver......」"

msgid "Taiga「Taking care of what exactly?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Resolver qué exactamente?」"

msgid "\"Don't forget our agreement on the＿morning of the 7th.\""
msgstr "\"No olvides nuestro acuerdo para la＿mañana del 7.\""

msgid "Ryuuji「（Looks like things will get complicated＿if I tell these two about it......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Parece que todo se complicará si les＿cuento de esto a estas dos......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I think I should tell Sensei about my＿amnesia. You know, to avoid problems＿in class and all that?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Creo que debería contarle a Sensei lo＿de mi amnesia. Ya sabes, para evitar＿problemas en clase y eso, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, that's okay! Kitamura agreed to＿come with me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No, está bien! Kitamura＿quedó en ir conmigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（One lie after another......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Una mentira tras otra......）」"

msgid "Taiga「Something's fishy...... You're hiding＿something, aren't you?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Aquí hay gato encerrado...... Estás＿ocultando algo, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「N-No I'm not.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No es verdad.」"

msgid "Minori「Hey now, Taiga. It's bad not to trust＿Takasu-kun, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「Vamos, Taiga. Está mal no confiar＿en Takasu-kun, amiga.」"

msgid "Taiga「But Ryuuji's acting kinda weird!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Pero Ryuuji está actuando algo raro!」"

msgid "Minori「Now, now. Even if Takasu-kun was＿hiding something, isn't it our job as his＿friends to respect his privacy, dude?」"
msgstr "Minori「Calma, calma. Aunque Takasu-kun ocultara＿algo, ¿no es nuestro deber como amigos＿respetar su privacidad, amiga?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You really are wise, Kushieda. You＿should try to follow her example, Taiga.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「De verdad eres sabia, Kushieda. Deberías＿seguir su ejemplo, Taiga.」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut it! Hurry and get lost!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate! ¡Apúrate y lárgate!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I'll do just that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, eso mismo haré.」"

msgid "Minori「Laters～」"
msgstr "Minori「Nos vemos～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I made an attempt at pancakes for＿breakfast today. I thought something＿like this would be nice after all the」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, hoy intenté hacer panqueques para＿el desayuno. Pensé que algo así vendría＿bien después de toda la」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Japanese food we've had lately.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「comida japonesa que hemos＿comido últimamente.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, shut up～ I just happen to be in the＿mood for something sweet this＿morning. More importantly, hurry and」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ay, cállate～ Justo hoy amanecí＿con antojo de algo dulce. Lo más＿importante, apúrate y」"

msgid "Taiga「make them already. Pancakes are best＿fresh.」"
msgstr "Taiga「hazlos de una vez. Los panqueques＿son mejores recién hechos.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji here's forgotten nearly＿everything, so I need you to take over,＿Minorin. I'm tired of jogging his」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji olvidó casi todo, así que＿necesito que tomes el relevo,＿Minorin. Ya me cansé de refrescarle la」"

msgid "Taiga「memory.」"
msgstr "Taiga「memoria.」"

msgid "Taiga「What? If that's how you feel, then I'm＿not helping you if you screw＿something up and the whole class」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué? Si así piensas, ¡no te ayudaré＿si arruinas algo y toda la clase」"

msgid "Taiga「gives you the cold shoulder!」"
msgstr "Taiga「te da la espalda!」"

msgid "Minori「Ha ha ha! Well, no matter what she＿says, if push comes to shove, I think＿Taiga would be the first in line to help」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ja, ja, ja! Diga lo que diga,＿a la hora de la verdad, creo＿que Taiga sería la primera en」"

msgid "Minori「you.」"
msgstr "Minori「ayudarte.」"

msgid "Minori「Ohhh. In that case, we can all go and＿explain everything. If you say \"I've got＿amnesia\" out of the blue, they might」"
msgstr "Minori「Ohhh. Entonces podemos ir todos＿a explicarlo. Si dices \"Tengo＿amnesia\" de repente, podrían」"

msgid "Minori「think you're screwing around.」"
msgstr "Minori「pensar que estás bromeando.」"
